WEBVTT

00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:03.890
Wheee! I'm flying!

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:08.600
Oof! Nuts!

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.930
Welcome to Hero Valley!

00:00:13.798 --> 00:00:17.770
Every place here has its very own superhero.

00:00:19.038 --> 00:00:24.038
Today, we're going to Sunny Meadow Park, home of Captain Caution!

00:00:29.918 --> 00:00:33.592
It was a windy day at Sunny Meadow Park.

00:00:36.338 --> 00:00:40.208
Look, Dad! My kite is flying so high!

00:00:40.698 --> 00:00:44.630
That's because you're the best kite pilot in the park!

00:00:45.622 --> 00:00:49.186
I'll get our snacks. Remember our rule?

00:00:49.712 --> 00:00:54.234
Stay where you can see you... and you can see me!

00:00:54.795 --> 00:00:58.953
Ha! Close enough. Stay where I can see you.

00:01:00.274 --> 00:01:03.234
Oh no! My kite!

00:01:04.154 --> 00:01:07.954
I'll help! Squirrel speed!

00:01:10.914 --> 00:01:15.560
The kite lands by a bench. A grown-up picks it up.

00:01:16.164 --> 00:01:18.924
Oh! Is this your kite?

00:01:19.424 --> 00:01:23.402
Psst. Alex. We don't know that grown-up.

00:01:26.904 --> 00:01:29.594
Hmm. What should I do?
